@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### 1. POST CREATE SUPPLIER (Lengkap dengan Penanggung Jawab & Email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "PT Sumber Pangan Abadi",
    "person_responsible": "Budi Santoso",
    "phone": "081234567890",
    "address": "Jl. Industri No. 88, Garut",
    "email": "supplier@sumberpangan.com",
    "is_active": true
}

### 2. POST CREATE SUPPLIER (Minimal Field Wajib)
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "CV Maju Jaya",
    "phone": "08129876512",
    "address": "Jl. Soekarno Hatta No. 120, Bandung",
    "is_active": true
}

### 3. GET ALL SUPPLIERS (Pagination default 20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Accept: application/json

### 4. GET SUPPLIERS WITH SEARCH (Filter berdasarkan kode supplier / nama)
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers?search=Sumber
Accept: application/json

### 5. GET SUPPLIERS WITH FILTER STATUS AKTIF
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers?is_active=1
Accept: application/json

### 6. GET SUPPLIERS WITH SEARCH AND FILTER STATUS
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers?search=Sumber&is_active=1
Accept: application/json

### 7. GET SUPPLIERS PAGINATION (Page 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers?page=2
Accept: application/json

### 8. GET SUPPLIERS DROPDOWN / OPTIONS (Hanya supplier aktif)
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/options
Accept: application/json

### 9. GET SUPPLIERS DROPDOWN WITH SEARCH (Cari nama / kode supplier)
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/options?search=Sumber
Accept: application/json

### 10. PATCH UPDATE SUPPLIER DATA
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/SPL-JMXJO9BY
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "name": "PT Sumber Pangan Abadi Sejahtera",
    "person_responsible": "Budi Santoso, S.E.",
    "phone": "081234567999",
    "address": "Jl. Industri No. 90, Garut",
    "email": "contact@sumberpangan.com",
    "is_active": true
}

### 11. UPDATE STATUS ONLY
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/SPL-JMXJO9BY
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "is_active": false
}
